  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial stable release.\n\t\t\t• HTTP response capture\n\t\t\t• HTTP response replay\n\t\t\t• Header preservation\n\t\t\t• ASP.NET Core integration\n\t\t\t• Dependency Injection support\n\t\t\t• Production-ready implementation\n\t\t\t1.2.0: Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 (previously net8.0 only). No public API or behavior change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new, and the net8.0 assembly is unchanged. The nuspec no longer declares Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions and Microsoft.Extensions.Options as package dependencies: both assemblies ship in the Microsoft.AspNetCore.App framework reference the package already carries, so consumers are unaffected.",
